      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'This game plays with twin stick. Currently no mouse aiming. So please
    play with controller, or you will die.


    There are two routes with different
    balance.


    Host a game first, then play, or share the join code and wait
    for another player to join.


    The current player weapon is ray based and
    pierces enemeis. Teh enemies weapon is projectile based and can bounce.


    Your
    current goal is to survive to the end'
