  m_text: 'In the Black is a TV gameshow where contestants can win enough money to
    finally pay off their debts.


    In this near future world poverty has been
    criminalised and the majority of the population placed under the care of the
    wealth.


    Most can never hope to gain independence, some chose to play glamourised
    TV death games with the chance to win fabulous prizes and fortune.

'
